      "Cool the liver and dice it.",
      "Heat about 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a clean pan. Add the garlic, onion, and ginger, and fry for about 3 minutes.",
      "Stir in curry powder, thyme, and bay leaf. Add the runner beans and carrot, and fry for a few minutes.",
      "Stir in the bell pepper, corn, spring onion, and diced liver. Season with salt to taste, and stir fry for a few minutes.",
      "Transfer the vegetables to the cooked rice. Stir and warm everything together over low heat to meld the flavors.",
      "Serve hot."
